<title>USA: First American Health names chairman.</title>
<headline>First American Health names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First American Health Concepts Inc said on Tuesday it named John Behrmann chairman.  It also named John Heidt to the newly-created position of vice chairman.</p>
<p>Behrmann has been a board member since November 1993. Heidt, who served as First American's chairman since August 1993, has been a director since 1989, the company said.</p>
